{
  "interface": "arak",
  "about": "Arak's colours (ADR 0009, Look: tokens, themes, typefaces). The palette is the prototype's (tools/screenshots/mobile-od-nule/koncept-2/KONCEPT.md): paper, ink, the desk under the sheet, the stamp's violet ink for everything the program writes onto a document, the yellow marker for a hit. Its translucent colours are written here already laid over the colour they sit on, so contrast can be computed from this file alone. tools/mobile-tokens.mjs writes tokens.css from it; tools/verify-mobile-tokens.mjs checks the contrast of every pair below and that tokens.css is what the generator writes.",
  "palette": {
    "desk": { "light": "#3B31A3", "dark": "#110C38" },
    "desk-ink": { "light": "#FFFFFF", "dark": "#F2F0FF" },
    "desk-ink-soft": { "light": "#D6D2FA", "dark": "#B5AFEB" },
